    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2007329030630940815",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/2007329030630940815",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/2007329030630940815",
      "text": "[6:35AM] \n#Mile12\n#Ketu\n#TrafficUpdate\nVehicular movement from Odo Ogun down to Ajegunle, Thomas and  Irawo is  appreciable at the moment.\n\nLeaving Irawo to Idera, Weigh bridge, Owode Onirin to Owode Elede down to Mile 12 is very encouraging.\n\nNavigating under Mile 12 bridge inward Ajelogo (Inward and outward) is still looking good.\n\nWhile Ascending and descending Mile 12 bridge inward kosofe down to Iyana School is appreciable at the moment as well.\n\nMovement from underneath the bridge of Mile 12  inward the main market is better for now.\n\nThe return journey from Iyana School to Kosofe down to Mile 12 is a better movement.\n\nAscending and descending Mile 12 bridge inward Owode Elede, Owode Onirin, Weigh bridge,  Idera, Irawo, Thomas,  Ajegunle down to Odo Ogun is traffic free.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
